Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting plans,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI'd want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head forth and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Great work, Ichigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And Niji, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you could say the war-torn brock collie\Nis just another victim of the fall of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the doflamingo regime once their army
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,could no longer source\Nweapons from him they
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,sought our military strength for assistance\Nsuppressing the enemy only got them so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,far half-hearted sympathy simply leads to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,more bloodshed such a\Npity who gives a crap
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,about their reasons whoever ponies up the\Nmost money gets the win it's that simple
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we couldn't play both sides in secret and\Neasily earn twice as much you know that's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,something a pirate would\Ndo let us not forget
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,our nation is still a member of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,government speaking of\Nwhich dad the reverie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,is just around the corner that's correct
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I suspect that they will likely\Nstrip us of our right to attend this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear this in mind, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The power we'll be gaining\Nis going to be tremendous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa will be forever changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare for something to\Nbring Dad this much pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd have predicted you'd\Ncome in handy one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.40,0:04:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It really took us by surprise\Nwhen you ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But we never forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name would come up from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We all had our own speculations about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We all assumed you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We even played a game where we'd come up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,with all the funny ways\Nyou might have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still food on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste it, Niji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, this, yeah. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.62,0:04:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I filled up on a ton of chocolate earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides this thick sauce looks disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You see how gooey and nasty it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going straight to the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know the value of food or\Nhow much effort goes into cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You stuck up, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You weakling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch who you're speaking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to insult me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the head, chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me Cosette.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This vile-looking slop you dared serve\Nus caused my brother to upset me! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I deeply apologize, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have offered a\Ndish so appalling to you. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't you move an inch, Cosette.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You low-life bastard, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to leave\Na scar on a lady's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really going to go to bed\Nfor a glorified kitchen wench?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a gentleman now there's\Nfood all over the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called aligo and\Nit's made from cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Blended into mashed potatoes,\Nmaster sanji, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Potatoes strengthen your immune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, they stabilize blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.98,0:07:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're very nutritious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume, due to your
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,noble status, this fine confit was\Ncarefully selected and prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an awfully elaborate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,dish to make for breakfast. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess her, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Royal blood must never eat off the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your damn mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's vile the flavor is impeccable
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Poverty's done a number on you Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a blemish on the Ventsmoke name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is beyond your comprehension,\Nbut I'm embarrassed to be related to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Disrespecting such fine food is one thing,\Nbut raising your hand to a woman is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you're born into royalty\Ndoesn't mean you can treat her like dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you guys represent\Ngoes against my principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji, your head is poisoned by\Nthe blustering ideology of the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since we were children, your\Nthinking has been incomprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Royalty abides by its own set of rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one out of touch here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brothers are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\Nthe world truly works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that your misguided\Nmind was corrupted by this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's network of information\Ncollectors is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that around two years\Nago you worked in his restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've uncovered the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A seafaring eatery called the Baratier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe this is a\Nrecent photo, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're turning as white as a ghost, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd all that chivalry go, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And those are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A preventative measure for\Nan unexpected bon voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can expect both\NSwahed and Monsieur Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,himself to attempt la\Nrésistance for la mariage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure it is seen all the way through,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you may have the bracelet along\Nwith the knowledge of his weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, this is only a safety\Nmeasure in the event you refuse to comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate to relieve this man\Nof his head if push comes to shove.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do anything\Ndrastic if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know what we're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget your friends and accept\Nyour marriage to pudding quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do that, and everything\Nwill work out just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're missing a leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense to sacrifice\Nso much for me, so why tell me why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For my entire life, I've\Nhad the same dream as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea all blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tang, you old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Sea Restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:11:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.04,0:12:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we're gonna be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause you got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're moving too slow, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around with\Nthe ladies, you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat. Little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:13:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough\Nfor all you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe my life to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a peaceful\Nwedding ceremony tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be having lunch today with Big\NMom and Pudding, so go get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll head over to her castle shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Any objections, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that damn straw\Nhat hiding the hunt is on
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ten minutes gotta recharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even use Haki yet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is somebody there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone call a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bastards, they waited\Nuntil I wasn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing she could\Nhave done to deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They beat a woman unconscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met a bigger scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave that homely commoner\Na taste of self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go and take that up with Niji,\Nconsidering he's the guilty party here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll take you to him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, it's gonna be okay, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, can't wait to settle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You ran away before any of us\Nwere old enough to come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,54 units of Type M-B,\N30 units of Type M-ST,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and 21 of Type M-H need restocks. Noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A beautiful sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason why Germa is\Nfeared around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to our famous soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The same Cracker?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, humor me, King Bowne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to explain why in the hell\Nyou're helping the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Velocita, it's a very good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On second, Dot, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just kill you all instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Sweet Three General Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's part of my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa double six soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they in water?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bioculture fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They all have the same face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they actually alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, human beings, can be constructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.99,0:19:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been a nation of\Nscience for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He may not look it, but\Nour old man is a renowned
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,scientist, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Got started long before we were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to be a part of a foreign research\Nteam operating outside of the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,exploring and developing weaponry with the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,infamous Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He worked alongside that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In his younger days, yeah. Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,vegapunk's breakthrough\Ndiscovery was the presence
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,of bloodline elements\Nwithin living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He essentially discovered the\Nblueprints of life and that's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,bound to ruffle some feathers\Nplaying god and all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so when the world government caught\Nwind of things they arrested vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The research team was disbanded or rather
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it was absorbed into\Nthe government however.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Dad was able\Nto evade their reach,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and secretly continue his\Nstudies here in Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That research being...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,duplicating and augmenting a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the very reason this\Nunderground facility was built.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All the soldiers here are synthetic\Nduplicates of a select few superior fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're clones, soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're clones?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,they're blissfully\Nunaware of that of course
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it's funny
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,nations all over the world\Nfear our soldiers but they
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,also wish they had some of\Ntheir own they envy our strength
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,what's more our men are as\Nobedient as they are strong they're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,programmed not to fear death\Nor ever turn on their masters
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:21:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,if they die we can just replace\Nthem it only takes five years to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.42,0:21:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,create a new 20 year old fighter\Nyou're looking at our soldier storage
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,depot check out this guy technically
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,five years old but ready for war
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,he doesn't even realize what he's\Nbeing robbed of stop it that's enough
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when we received word\Nthat you would become a pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought maybe the little failure might
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.06,0:21:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,have gotten his feet\Nwet and grown up some.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But it turns out you're still a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Niji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You sick bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you working?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a big head now, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll treat her like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You attacked a girl, a cute girl, so\Nnow you're gonna pay back off, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we're still.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,holding a certain somebody\Nhostage in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you actually like that\Nlittle cooking wench?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.64,0:22:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.36,0:23:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Make one wrong move, and someone will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I knew you liked her, I\Nwouldn't have messed up her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But oh well, too late now, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, kind of a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if the busted-up\Nface isn't a deal-breaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.68,0:23:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,then maybe I can make her\Nyour personal attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.58,0:23:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all of us, together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.76,0:23:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you're one of us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.58,0:24:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, on that note, I think we should\Nre-establish the hierarchy around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.94,0:24:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, you are a worthless failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Children, of all the things I've\Nbuilt, you are the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an incredible team of\Nscientifically modified superhumans.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.50,0:24:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans, the fruits of my extensive\Nresearch—brilliance, unlike normal humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.38,0:24:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are unbound by emotion;
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.02,0:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,soon you'll command military\Nforces of your own and one
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,day lead Germa Double Six\Ntoward even greater heights!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to the power of\Nscience I gave you—the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to train.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.80,0:24:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to train
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.70,0:25:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, it's your turn to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.50,0:25:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, it burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Sanji, who died?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.28,0:26:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.86,0:26:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.50,0:26:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.86,0:26:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you keep playing\Nwith that dumb turtle for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.72,0:26:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that? You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.14,0:26:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.14,0:27:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That should teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.46,0:27:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.14,0:27:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can both!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.92,0:27:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.00,0:27:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel low, DG!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.26,0:27:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the fight's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.90,0:27:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.18,0:27:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Sanji so weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.50,0:27:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The gap in their scores keeps increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.96,0:27:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the test results back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.14,0:28:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ichiji, Niji, and Yonji are making\Nexcellent progress in their training.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.04,0:28:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Their exoskeletons have developed and\Naccording to the data we've gathered,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,their flexibility and strength are\Nalready equivalent to those of grown men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.42,0:28:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, it pains me\Nto tell you, but Yon Sanji is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on. Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.68,0:28:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, he's proven\Nhimself to be a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.72,0:28:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We were certain that we\Nhad successfully modified
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.62,0:28:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the bloodline elements\Nfor each of the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.26,0:28:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But for some unknown reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji seemed to have converted back\Nto their original configuration.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.46,0:28:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.82,0:28:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.82,0:28:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.00,0:28:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.91,0:28:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but why'd you help? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.18,0:29:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd rather I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.98,0:29:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you do. You're nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.48,0:29:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.06,0:29:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When they're mean, you\Nlaugh also. How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.52,0:29:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.34,0:29:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I try to stop them, then\Nthey'll just start picking on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.80,0:29:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.14,0:29:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.22,0:29:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.62,0:29:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.08,0:29:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.66,0:29:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.30,0:29:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.21,0:29:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're cooking for the\Nrats again, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.88,0:29:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you royalty\Ndoesn't serve anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.36,0:29:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.96,0:29:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dead, and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.06,0:29:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop trying to be like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.14,0:29:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike your siblings, you were\Nborn without an ounce of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.18,0:30:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'll train. Hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.44,0:30:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred times harder than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.88,0:30:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.86,0:30:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,which means you're an integral part of my\Nplan to restore the Germa Empire's glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not disappoint me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever cook again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.24,0:30:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Slowpoke, can't you run any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.70,0:30:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no potential?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.42,0:30:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it seems he's simply a waste of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.44,0:30:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor son lost in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.10,0:30:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How tragic!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.32,0:31:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to see the day that all five\Nof my children became warriors for Germa,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.46,0:31:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but sadly our precious Sanji\Nwas taken from us far too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.92,0:31:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.40,0:31:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.34,0:31:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.94,0:31:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Sanji's really dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.32,0:31:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need that loser around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.70,0:31:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't lock me up forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but your father was\Nthe one who decided this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.72,0:32:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is harsh, but this is not a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.62,0:32:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He intends to make it as\Nif you were never born.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.76,0:32:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I do wrong, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.18,0:32:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.80,0:32:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.42,0:32:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I was forced to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.02,0:32:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.90,0:32:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't live in here by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! No!
